BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.357 0.424 0.506 rg
51.0236220472441033 413.2915748031495013 Td
(A. It applies inverse coordinate changes in reverse order, reconstructs the vector in standard coordinates, and compares it) Tj
T* (with the original input.) Tj
