BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.357 0.424 0.506 rg
51.0236220472441033 359.7167716535431623 Td
(A. Floating-point arithmetic rounds results. A small difference such as 1e-15 can be normal; a tolerance like 1e-9 allows) Tj
T* (harmless rounding while detecting meaningful errors.) Tj
